ate </div><div class="oneColDiv"> <img name="formHeaderLogoId" height="45" src="http://www.healthlink.net/external/eref/images/winz_logo.png"></div> </div> </div> <div class="rowDiv"> <span class="fourColDiv"> <div class="section" id="patientDetailsSection"> <b>Patient:</b> <b>DUSHYANT KALIA</b>, 18yrs, M, DOB 27/06/1997, PH: Mob 0220211473 <br> </div> <div class="section" id="patientPostalAddressSection"> 19B Titoki Street, Lansdowne, Masterton 5810 </div> </span> </div> <div class="section" id="referrerDetailsSection"> <div class="rowDiv"> <span class="fourColDiv "><b>Referred by:</b> Cath Becker, Masterton Medical, NZMC 22059, PH 06-370-0011, FAX 06-378-0050 </span> </div> </div> <div class="rowDiv"> <span class="fourColDiv"> <b>Referral date:</b> 29/06/2015 10:03:42 </span> </div> <br class="clearFloat"> <!-- service specific forms --> <div class="contentSection" id="clinicalContainer"> <div class="sectionHeaderRowDiv"> <div class="sectionHeaderTitleDivNew">Capacity to Work</div> </div> <div id="genericReferralDetailsDiv"> <div class="rowDiv"> <div class="twoColDiv colHeader">Capacity to Work</div> </div> <div class="rowDiv"> <div class="threeColDiv">Does the person have a health condition, injury or disability that presents a barrier/limitation to work?</div> <div class="oneColDiv">Yes</div> </div> <div class="rowDiv"> <div class="fourColDiv">What are the barriers/limitations to work for the person from the health condition/injury or disability?</div> </div> <div class="rowDiv"> <div class="fourColDiv">Recovering from injury</div> </div> <!-- start of table ---------------> <div class="rowDiv" id="clinicalConditionTableSectionDiv"> <div class="fourColDiv">Select at least one health condition, injury or disability (including READ code) that is presenting a barrier to full-time work</div> <div class="fourColDiv"> <div class="whiteSmokeTheme"> <table class="fourColTable" id="clinicalConditionTableId"> <thead> <tr> <th style="width: 100px;">Read Code</th> <th style="width: 220px;">Description</th> <th style="width: 100px;">ACC Claim</th> <th style="width: 180px;">Primary</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td style="width: 100px;">S100.00</td> <td style="width: 220px;">Closed # cervical spine</td> <td style="width: 180px;">No</td> <td style="width: 180px;">Yes</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> </div> </div> <!-- end of table ---------------> <!-- ACC claim table-------------------------> <!-- ACC claim table-------------------------> <div class="rowDiv"> <div class="twoColDiv">When was the person's capacity to work reduced from?</div> <div class="oneColDiv">29/06/2015</div> </div> <div class="rowDiv"> <div class="rowDiv"> <div class="fourColDiv">In the future is the persons capacity expected to (you can choose one or more options if applicable):</div> </div> <div class="rowDiv"> <ul> <li>Improve and allow them to regularly undertake full-time work with appropriate accommodations and support</li> </ul> </div> </div> <div class="rowDiv"> <div class="fourColDiv">What treatments and/or support is the person receiving to manage or improve their condition?</div> </div> <div class="rowDiv"> <div class="fourColDiv">Under the care of Orhtopaedic Surgeons at Midcentral Hospital</div> </div> <div class="rowDiv"> <div class="fourColDiv">What supports, services, adjustments or accommodations could be put in place to assist the person into suitable and open employment?</div> </div> <div class="rowDiv"> <div class="fourColDiv">Collar, ABI acute brain injury <br>Dr Robin Sekerak</div> </div> <div class="rowDiv"> <div class="fourColDiv">Currently, can the person undertake suitable and open employment if accommodations, support and services are provided?</div> </div> <div class="rowDiv"> <div class="fourColDiv">No current capacity to work</div> </div> <div class="rowDiv"> <div class="threeColDiv">Is the person expected to have the capacity to work regularly in suitable and open employment (15 hours a week or more) within the next two years?</div> <div class="halfColDiv"></div> <div class="halfColDiv">Yes</div> </div> <div class="rowDiv"> <div class="fourColDiv">Please select one of the following:</div> </div> <div class="rowDiv"> <div class="fourColDiv">This person's capacity to work should be reviewed from</div> </div> <div class="rowDiv"> <div class="twoColDiv">Please provide date</div> <div class="oneColDiv">27/07/2015</div> </div> <!-- start of PREGNANT ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------> <!-- end of Pregnant section ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------> <!-- blind section starts --> <div class="rowDiv"> <hr> </div> <div class="rowDiv"> <div class="twoColDiv colHeader">Blind</div> </div> <div class="rowDiv"> <div class="twoColDiv">Is the person 'Totally Blind'?</div> <div class="oneColDiv">No</div> </div> <!-- blind section ends --> <!-- Hospitalisation starts --> <div class="rowDiv"> <hr> </div> <div class="rowDiv"> <div class="twoColDiv colHeader">Hospitalisation</div> </div> <div class="rowDiv"> <div class="oneColDiv">Is the person in hospital?</div> <div class="oneColDiv">No</div> </div> <!-- Hospitalisation ends --> <!-- Comments section starts--> <div class="rowDiv"> <hr> </div> <div class="rowDiv"> <div class="fourColDiv colHeader">Comments</div> </div> <div class="rowDiv"> <div class="threeColDiv">Would you like Work and Income to contact you about this person's condition or ability to work?</div> <div class="oneColDiv">No</div> </div> <div class="rowDiv"> <div class="threeColDiv">Would a second opinion be useful?</div> <div class="oneColDiv">No</div> </div> <!-- Comments section ends --> <!-- Practitioner section Starts --> <div class="rowDiv"> <hr> </div> <!-- Practitioner Information section START --> <div class="rowDiv"> <div class="fourColDiv colHeader">Practitioner Information</